  title: Jail Time
  headliner: <b>Mayor Issues Jail Ultimatum To Anyone Blocking New Manila's Beautification</b>
  bodyText: 'Doubling down on his contentious cleanup drive, Mayor Johan "Mang Danny"
    declared during a tense press briefing this morning that anyone attempting to
    physically block or impede city painting crews will face immediate arrest and
    jail time. '
